          "clause": "§7.21.6.1 ¶8 (conversion g)",
          "quote": "Let P equal the precision if nonzero, 6 if the precision is omitted, or 1 if the precision is zero. Then, if a conversion with style E would have an exponent of X: if P > X ≥ −4, the conversion is with style f (or F) and precision P − (X + 1).",
